        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Approximately 8–10 superficial erosions, 0.5–2 cm, erythematous, some with collarette scale and light honey-colored crust at the edges. Mild surrounding erythema; no increased warmth, induration, or fluctuance."
      }
    },
